{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17213","headline":"和职方殷郎中留滞江汉初至南宫呈诸公幷见寄 · 权德舆","name":"和职方殷郎中留滞江汉初至南宫呈诸公幷见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十载别文昌，藩符寄武当。\n师贞上介辟，恩擢正员郎。\n藻思烟霞丽，归轩印绶光。\n还希驻辇问，莫自叹冯唐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}